	(text "Motor channel - one per leaf, instantiated x4. Implements: COL-COTS-0028 (DRV8214, integrated current sense + ripple counting) - vault Main-Board-01 Motor Channel. Layout: docs/design/parts/DRV8214.md. PAD + GND to the GND plane via thermal vias. VREF = +3V3 (TI typical app). PROVISIONAL: R_IPROPI, pull-ups."
